    "1_5_002sht_1_5_002_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:6122a1821e8b287792ff226c1ec0049271dbdefa003968494d3fc71c71299e44",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_00_2:1_5_002_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "今日も僕が一番目立っちゃうかな？\nま、仕方ないよね♪",
        "text": "今天也是我最引人注目吧？\n嘛，也是没办法的事嘛♪",
        "source_hash": "sha256:752be1278ed3dfbbc1d0b95a2b3b0f64e23af0cac23c34cdb987adc7f94d7703",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_00_2:1_5_002_00_2:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_003hok_1_5_003_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:1cb78d6c7cb1f667f06db79378327b26d53b9b213768664ed671b930310c8fc9",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_00_3:1_5_003_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "さて、と。少し走ってきますね。\n本番前に体を温めておきたいので。",
        "text": "那么。我去稍微跑跑步。\n想在正式开始前把身体活动开。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:eeef671d9570f0d2779e952bba630067dc3ebafc838e20063f80cb0eed588c8b",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_003hok_1_5_003_00_3:1_5_003_00_3:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_004ter_1_5_004_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:7a9d1d68085859f17e3f96a26f84ed8fe8e2a82ee6add7ecbd18194dbf9560b4",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_004ter_1_5_004_00_8:1_5_004_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "準備運動はしっかりしておかないとなー。\nストレッチ、手伝ってくれるか？",
        "text": "准备运动可得好好做才行啊～\n能帮我做拉伸吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:988b941fdfe060b55b6a2d000db66c6549f4564484756e613d6d085111fa3145",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_004ter_1_5_004_00_8:1_5_004_00_8:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_004ter_1_5_004_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:6ab4abc78bdb3ea7dcf644de9aa5ea4a4e7f8491c70c777514b3d2732b309b16",
      "title": 190,
      "opening": {
        "source": "今回オファーをいただいたCMで使う\nインスタントコーヒーのサンプルです。",
        "text": "这是这次接到邀约的广告里要用的\n速溶咖啡样品。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:efdf4e89f79d62d00117512db5ddd4c6983ebe485ea4b2a675a2477015563760",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_004ter_1_5_004_01:1_5_004_01:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:fff1225e8accfd21dfb3e1343a053ec99dff3860ef7c2784206dc3854b36cb6e",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_00_7:1_5_006_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "さっきのレッスンで教えてもらったところを\n復習したいので、残って練習してもいいですか？",
        "text": "我想复习一下刚才课上学到的地方，\n可以留下来继续练习吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d4c31373ee6b26a6954883fe404e476eb61df30dc44636657cbd0db4fd5c5b7e",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_00_7:1_5_006_00_7:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:c674aad852e50a798fdbf5ef5063ab7e42b053851f034075d854acb962cbb161",
      "title": 199,
      "opening": {
        "source": "「ここまで来られたのは君たちの努力の結果だ」",
        "text": "“能走到今天这一步，全靠你们努力的成果”",
        "source_hash": "sha256:8b67e0594191b5805aa20bacfde1a56f024509c5e834509ca1f3916eea7b3cf3",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_006tsu_1_5_006_02:1_5_006_02:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_008rei_1_5_008_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:5098573c3820285247e786da11e63c1658356fa5b53ef010b7f8f0de4ec6f1d9",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_00_3:1_5_008_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "時間がまだあるようだな。\n改めて本番の流れを確認しておこう。",
        "text": "看起来还有时间。\n重新确认一遍正式演出的流程吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:7872a69bbe8b0fe46f2899d557b2f2d7be84e878fa5d7be5c2320267b07994b5",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_008rei_1_5_008_00_3:1_5_008_00_3:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_011min_1_5_011_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:a81e5f7d81b1da662141f3d6651f6215f60e0c21762195d59142e2d884828a7e",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_011min_1_5_011_00_3:1_5_011_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "ふう……。台本も大分頭に入ったし、\nそろそろ休憩しようかな。",
        "text": "呼……剧本也差不多都记在脑子里了，\n差不多该休息一下了吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:43b1d4649cff4fdc50a0052dbe8793d89164e1b8a7a6fd32dcce66daf0a2093f",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_011min_1_5_011_00_3:1_5_011_00_3:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_012yus_1_5_012_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:83dddef8309e7c5c862c502c8d9f9b1aefee6083d618a3d6751ed83803fd6540",
      "title": 224,
      "opening": {
        "source": "「先輩、お疲れ様です！」",
        "text": "“前辈，辛苦了！”",
        "source_hash": "sha256:b6a1a8741b7570ddf1e9a826065280c5df48c3dc4e51aa476c5dcc3296670535",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_03:1_5_012_03:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_013kys_1_5_013_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:ef37437af8cce2b4d8556dd6426eca4dab29fbca7137bc28e8f7737d234f4c85",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_013kys_1_5_013_00_2:1_5_013_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "仕事が終わったら録画してたサッカーの試合を悠介と\n見る約束をしてるんだ。だから頑張らないとな！",
        "text": "我已经和悠介约好，工作结束后\n要一起看录下来的足球比赛了。所以得加油才行啊！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:2b16a90016564bf0c54f7ab250fb48f16c8f5aac3284c442ed2d06e6ae8bcbae",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_013kys_1_5_013_00_2:1_5_013_00_2:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_014hid_1_5_014_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:c5e5618904ce756514992c39d4c5c7803b10a617603a5ca8e0198bef24f00497",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_00_4:1_5_014_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "信頼ってのは一朝一夕で培えるものじゃねぇ。\nだからこそ価値がある……あんたもそう思うだろ？",
        "text": "信任这东西可不是一朝一夕就能培养起来的。\n正因如此才弥足珍贵……你也是这么想的吧？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:e89865c16c14c641abe8ca72df79b5d213f0cdca91eb7b927f1b4e8e13330310",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_014hid_1_5_014_00_4:1_5_014_00_4:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:1ede1e2116f234d82b91ef414837c1904e2ee8e1a95c58f5f48ddda7102d042b",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_00_7:1_5_015_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "この後、誠司さん家で夕飯をご馳走になるんだ！\n誠司さんのハンバーグ、絶品なんだよなぁ……。",
        "text": "待会儿，我要去诚司先生家蹭晚饭吃！\n诚司先生做的汉堡排，简直是一绝啊……",
        "source_hash": "sha256:deafcca6ccddd5f130e19604ee09b8a033cba76052f9f5db8b2474da463b684b",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_00_7:1_5_015_00_7:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:3a102b1b9f8d91937615ffd4ad0e4ee5382af8b46feb4b191f2aee297671e022",
      "title": 235,
      "opening": {
        "source": "うーん……主人公の背中を押すクールな先輩か。\nなかなか役が掴めないな。",
        "text": "唔——……在背后推主角一把的冷酷前辈吗？\n总觉得很难把握这个角色啊。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:84d9ca1799c130542cbbc3997db0d4240b33b4a76512c8cc77a244300508a692",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_015ryu_1_5_015_02:1_5_015_02:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_016sei_1_5_016_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:26aa42fbb740cfe89ea7f2902f647f7a0f54271cc43683c7275cf283340247b9",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_016sei_1_5_016_00_2:1_5_016_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "自分にはどんな仕事が向いているかわからない。\nだから、色んな仕事をさせてほしいんだ。",
        "text": "我不知道自己适合什么样的工作。\n所以，希望能让我尝试各种各样的工作。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:34c81c5d2fd10a9d576222f94c93ea3bc3b6367d83533225914ee502b62eddff",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_016sei_1_5_016_00_2:1_5_016_00_2:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_017kir_1_5_017_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:14234c1aefef22393e082f45567037269d27557e147156a93c2cb2acdecd3031",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_00_1:1_5_017_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●プロデューサークン、\n今日も一日頑張るでにゃんすよ！",
        "text": "●●●●プロデューサー君，\n今天一整天也要加油喵！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:6047d2fcbe1fa1d528d7a134d1677fa81c7006eacaec69965f642d124fa585d9",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_00_1:1_5_017_00_1:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_018shm_1_5_018_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:1de0e3568cd8be5bf21f31dcd8b1857e9a470cee82a3bc0304e850e124921983",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_00_7:1_5_018_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "アタシが未経験の仕事でも、どんどん入れちゃって。\nきっちりやり遂げてみせるわ。",
        "text": "就算是我没经验的工作，也尽管接过来吧。\n我一定会圆满完成的。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:7a10cacb77d55e11ce08efd2d2792031d286a855575227e00da6480e4b73b26e",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_00_7:1_5_018_00_7:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_018shm_1_5_018_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:7f0c946b77fa69ef710f0aa86753ec1874fe7908aac64d10cb8b0db80a6169d9",
      "title": 247,
      "opening": {
        "source": "気持ちのいい天気だねェ。いつも以上に\n太陽の存在を感じるわ。海だもの。当然よね。",
        "text": "天气真舒服啊。比平时更能真切地\n感受到太阳的存在呢。毕竟是在海边嘛，这也难怪。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:ae54539b5036002bec5a4ba3b70fe7a2fe3a4f37363106264641e2676c506cf7",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_018shm_1_5_018_02:1_5_018_02:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_020hay_1_5_020_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:973c7a812a79a8d5c2c01f277e9cda6e3c3c54bb8d759aafc520576c87ce5746",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_020hay_1_5_020_00_1:1_5_020_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●プロデューサー、どうかな。\nタイとか曲がってない？　大丈夫？",
        "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，怎么样？\n领带没有歪吧？没问题吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:02f52d5dd3c0a537f53d623ee413b85d16923435fcc51ac85464fbaa46e63064",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_020hay_1_5_020_00_1:1_5_020_00_1:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_022nat_1_5_022_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:be6c806c05621d92cf7a0a7fc691a9ff97f105522be0f551ce25a3a7f7db7669",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_022nat_1_5_022_00_4:1_5_022_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "次の撮影のスケジュール……これで、合ってる？\n……うん、ありがとう。確認できて、良かった。",
        "text": "下次拍摄的日程……是这样，没错吧？\n……嗯，谢谢。能确认好，太好了。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:9daa42d44a05d102f4adaa0c468b8a4741cfe1a6da9d606a89eb4909dda8be69",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_022nat_1_5_022_00_4:1_5_022_00_4:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_023har_1_5_023_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:96bf41faf539e5515510bee5d1b43a60f9583f8206c278cc3d4c9cba976fa23d",
      "title": 268,
      "opening": {
        "source": "へえ、そうなんですね。\nそれじゃ、この場合はどうすればいいんですか？",
        "text": "诶，是这样啊。\n那这种情况下该怎么做才好呢？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:fadab94666fc30736ece39d46b0cb79ad1ba033abdbac6d83a338653f86f89c8",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_023har_1_5_023_03:1_5_023_03:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_024shk_1_5_024_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:48aff4db2a4f120de3e77a988de6b69f5679f783270bc25a0bf1e36904b8d091",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_00_3:1_5_024_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "オレ、先輩たちのことマジメガリスペクト\nしてるっす！　早く追いつけるように頑張るっすよ！",
        "text": "我对前辈们真的是超级Mega尊敬！\n为了早日赶上大家，我会加油的！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:0fa0e83790a07f0090464720b288a691114eed6af1409c9df4c43d2380e5c111",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_00_3:1_5_024_00_3:cmd-000019:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_026gen_1_5_026_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:5e1caa8656bb48377c782e4b993e6e4dc2626604b50227ccda5d7b93dd6738d4",
      "title": 281,
      "opening": {
        "source": "小学校ではそんな遊びが流行ってんのか。\nそいつは楽しそうだ。",
        "text": "小学里流行这种游戏啊。\n听起来蛮有意思的。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:68106cf1fbecf6c6f44245fa4d16390ff3adc6e8ce393f0aac51e62f6ec29dd9",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_04:1_5_026_04:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:5c59137f21746d6d3acefe3b9e973f0e47f33271a7472725e6b46594a5318dc0",
      "title": 284,
      "opening": {
        "source": "幸広さん、お待たせしました。こちらが\n今度出演される紅茶のCMの資料になります。",
        "text": "幸广先生，让您久等了。这是\n您下次要出演的红茶CM的相关资料。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:90963d4bf49fa411aa786c109fdbe4b097655af4530604ed86d170e232444bce",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_03:1_5_027_03:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_028soi_1_5_028_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:c7862fb66ff2e27789b904a6b5a55e4c7fa778b4f9e40fcfbe6c05c2e0e7f4a8",
      "title": 288,
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●プロデューサーさん、お疲れさまです。\nこちらにいらしたんですね。",
        "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。\n原来您在这儿啊。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:faace0525c1c401c2688d1d545cce5480bc0b7153ea442671e4cff9f59b9e354",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_028soi_1_5_028_03:1_5_028_03:cmd-000020:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_029ass_1_5_029_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:8d331664dafd38372960c5533b0b92997cf3bf91a4251418ca092ab17fff3cda",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_029ass_1_5_029_00_8:1_5_029_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "主の賛美は闇の魔力を増幅させ、我の力となろう！\nアーッハッハッハッ！",
        "text": "吾主的赞美令暗之魔力倍增，化为本座的力量！\n啊——哈哈哈！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:3db62e5c33f2a332df3fdfd23ec328dfe479e4579c5553cf037297420fb69daa",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_029ass_1_5_029_00_8:1_5_029_00_8:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_029ass_1_5_029_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:15ef5fce704b4b96235080c330ab953b6746674d02f9fdd4951823bfa193e3a1",
      "title": 290,
      "opening": {
        "source": "アスランさん、\n機材トラブルで収録が遅れるそうです。",
        "text": "阿斯兰先生，\n因为设备故障，录制好像要推迟了。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:98d36ff4bffdd80826d6b23f78147b122c3ce8fbc040ba13c161edb9d4c7c2c5",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_029ass_1_5_029_01:1_5_029_01:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_032nao_1_5_032_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:a027fe7c7e80e4304ded0e2043bc6bb686bfe3969f7fa3c2f31e83430f8cd4d1",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_032nao_1_5_032_00_3:1_5_032_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "みんなの足を引っ張らないように、\nもっとレッスン頑張らなくちゃ。",
        "text": "为了不给大家拖后腿，\n我必须更加努力练习才行。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:2274c654c1702e9352916e7599b4cc7dfc706cce1be0e21033d5941e7f2434d3",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_032nao_1_5_032_00_3:1_5_032_00_3:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_033shr_1_5_033_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:309f9abe021b54eb230e1fbe819c74b147270a0d83fd9ab1fb9bb58b817020ea",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_033shr_1_5_033_00_4:1_5_033_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "よっしゃ、●●●●プロデューサー！\nバシッと決めてくるからな！",
        "text": "太好啦，●●●●プロデューサー！\n我这就去帅气地搞定它！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:99b2c3769042aba0d949e755a104f91bbf431b5a6e4f571e02e2a93335800f95",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_033shr_1_5_033_00_4:1_5_033_00_4:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_035mco_1_5_035_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:ee8e5c5e6dabba7b0a531a2e08c4b5818003322ac28dad820ef88c09b1f412f8",
      "title": 316,
      "opening": {
        "source": "お疲れさまです……って、道夫さん！\nど、どうしたんですか、この本の山は！？",
        "text": "辛苦了……话说，道夫先生！\n这、这一大堆书是怎么回事！？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:10ed982b1509163b93d76a894c82b5df590c7b35d277190f3af2401aa9457149",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_03:1_5_035_03:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_036rui_1_5_036_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:4cefb9e518dc0b65fec2a9a6c030809f66cb963b48722e5cadc9ad9c5f7fac9c",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_00_5:1_5_036_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "Wow！　差し入れを持って来てくれたのかい？\nThank you！",
        "text": "Wow！带了慰问品过来吗？\nThank you！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:5d7b8d61bc926d94d3fc81426149be5e35a826ff374c46132580a5dddf3fcb57",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_00_5:1_5_036_00_5:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_037jir_1_5_037_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:e3fddb7d37051dc2d7f48e3e64479775a0213373b980271045fc74483dccb804",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_037jir_1_5_037_00_2:1_5_037_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●プロデューサーちゃんも\n期待してくれてるし、ま、頑張って来ますか。",
        "text": "既然●●●●プロデューサー酱也\n这么期待，那大叔我也加把劲去干吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:b9b437137042f156a6f9b699654c909cb24e8631ec1d51f21de8eb394c12081c",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_037jir_1_5_037_00_2:1_5_037_00_2:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_038tak_1_5_038_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:927b7a3194b0e8a16b689ed35cd37d28f057502184f88b0a17d02b2d68bff212",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_038tak_1_5_038_00_1:1_5_038_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "最初の流れは、たしか……。\n本番前にもう一度、台本を確認しておくか。",
        "text": "最初的流程，我记得是……\n正式开始前再确认一遍台本吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:83abf09e4a7237338ef8780c1042b53ee2094b7538e7b2e2244c607a00ac690d",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_038tak_1_5_038_00_1:1_5_038_00_1:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:b86ff9f0e7c271709d9fbafa17e44e2798057d2cc7172b1218fbcd277f0e99bd",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_00_5:1_5_039_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "テレビ収録とステージは違う緊張感があるッス。\nどっちも頑張るッスよ！",
        "text": "电视录制和舞台有着截然不同的紧张感呢。\n两边我都会全力以赴的！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:be9a5d810ed6186c8b7bd57aab7f177cb2183f130250ea882df6c037ec714c26",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_00_5:1_5_039_00_5:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_040ren_1_5_040_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:6ed083891237a59d5676697939531baf6d74e274fe0b1c8918711162a533b84f",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_00_6:1_5_040_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "ふぁ～……トレーニングだァ？　せっかく\n気持ちよく寝てたのに、起こすんじゃねェ。",
        "text": "哈～啊……特训？亏本大爷\n睡得那么香，别来吵醒我啊。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:499209d45175eb9ffa84b644bf0797479c9c4e793d3eca8752f2bcf8be689d0e",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_040ren_1_5_040_00_6:1_5_040_00_6:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:2ccbe90716ad58404eec53a55dee022e90d3a5e53761f1ea99208f698446d099",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_00_3:1_5_041_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "ここへ来る前に時間があったので\n川原をお散歩してきたんです。",
        "text": "来这里之前还有点时间，\n所以我就去河滩边散了会儿步。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:eaf2d79a0c7f0eda71da2e3a9e286aee3415312ed94d3a708788e22b5f041435",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_00_3:1_5_041_00_3:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:267cf0d55644c9011a58780b3a7bd2a1992c6321247dde056e4e0d31af43a9d0",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_00_7:1_5_043_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "…川のせせらぎを聴きながら走るのは悪くない。\nいつもよりたくさん走れる気がするんだ。",
        "text": "…听着河水潺潺的声音跑步感觉并不坏。\n总觉得能比平时跑得更远。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:44474a94ebbebcc4158670c329721d08dca18d26e32deabb97f6813d2a66f6b2",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_00_7:1_5_043_00_7:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:5d30f0623679762b06195c209663d54a116263dafe65dfd9365258b41e1e2e30",
      "title": 347,
      "opening": {
        "source": "…ファッションブランドのイメージキャラクターか。\n精一杯務めさせてもらおう。",
        "text": "…时尚品牌的形象代言人吗。\n我会全力以赴胜任的。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:7055564a84cd6cab47e850b2ddf63098389e0642a2a7e09de8089047c0bf6980",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02:1_5_043_02:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_044ame_1_5_044_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:65a4e37a5d2ce8caaeb9540466a732effaedf1debdea31796447353d5a66882c",
      "title": 352,
      "opening": {
        "source": "本日は作業着メーカーのCM撮影になります。",
        "text": "今天是工作服厂商的广告拍摄。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:5f8b9119148ef7810679d515a842b664518fb7a4ee6f9023584576063db99c95",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_03:1_5_044_03:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_045sor_1_5_045_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:ddbf079864cb4dcf2f69f11aafa7b0567f77792e044f08d55d5000ae8f0583f8",
      "title": 357,
      "opening": {
        "source": "いざゆかん心が躍る旅の道。\nもうすぐ収録現場に到着するねー。",
        "text": "欣然启程路，心潮逐浪高。\n马上就要到录制现场了呢～",
        "source_hash": "sha256:a91c6fdc71ec53ecd9811a9788e0c37ae5b0ef4f7d3e0e4c5ecd886e33741b0e",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_045sor_1_5_045_04:1_5_045_04:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_046chr_1_5_046_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:4ec21617a5f1c7afd74dcfc92c57e4c6183947fe53312c5b1ba79d14b4586e81",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_046chr_1_5_046_00_4:1_5_046_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "雨彦と想楽……仲間と共に、これからも\nアイドルという大海原を渡っていきたいです。",
        "text": "雨彦和想乐……今后我也想和伙伴们一起，\n横渡偶像这片汪洋大海。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:f047d4d69aac4e92deac43610ac15545ed4f24311a512bdcb8bf3ceade14066d",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_046chr_1_5_046_00_4:1_5_046_00_4:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_047shu_1_5_047_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:43ba8b5fdd36401a282d4fb1a6587374c15d168e517ae45b269e1c8a2b0a1824",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_00_7:1_5_047_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "レッスンが終わったら、百々人先輩と鋭心先輩と\nダンスを合わせる約束をしてるんだ。",
        "text": "训练结束后，我和百百人前辈还有锐心前辈\n约好了一起配合练习舞蹈。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:bdbf23d6f6979d502fd81a1a837be0aade99249202c8ec5a539b9d62cd0b9d9e",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_00_7:1_5_047_00_7:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_047shu_1_5_047_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:4a531cdb8e83888262a7e328a004f5ebd6d53d0396d860541413f797df9501ab",
      "title": 363,
      "opening": {
        "source": "曲の聴きどころ、ですか？\nもちろん、『全部』かな。",
        "text": "歌曲的亮点是哪里，对吧？\n那当然是，“全部”了吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:6fa0f310c4cf2ecef1bfa71a6722c5ad5bf0c3be065aeb4069b68b2402a7d275",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_02:1_5_047_02:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_048mom_1_5_048_00_0": {
      "revision": "sha256:519d3e12c5a902f6793e88df3895c18dde5d1c7649530090f06f5a3a663733ee",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_00_0:1_5_048_00_0:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "ねえ、●●●●●●●●●●ぴぃちゃん。\n仕事中は僕から目をそらさないでね？　約束だよ。",
        "text": "呐，●●●●●●●●●●P酱。\n工作的时候视线不可以从我身上移开哦？说好了哦。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9e951b14b5f9e5d1395a78f3f8f275dee9a7fda43f0a3ec815425d6084fdad3",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_00_0:1_5_048_00_0:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_049eis_1_5_049_00_2": {
      "revision": "sha256:3079f078aab1e338e62c2ef59d1f1b7d354e2d7364faf56862990731618977bb",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_00_2:1_5_049_00_2:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "歓声がまだ聞こえてくるな。\n観客に満足してもらえてよかった。",
        "text": "欢呼声似乎还萦绕在耳畔。\n能让观众满意就太好了。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:e6300bd64a5307d28feaf03ce535d6582572664c6443738cd880405b669164fb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_00_2:1_5_049_00_2:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "5_01_003_22_a": {
      "revision": "sha256:f4ea1e6006f821e30217343753318d12c6839d2ee1d699274768dc49129232f6",
      "record": {
        "source": "仕事終わりのご褒美に",
        "text": "工作结束后的奖励",
        "source_hash": "sha256:8a34b1e0db4316ee89894d315ef15800f0dd2cd492e814ab1ef487b8c9bccd12",
        "unit_id": "metadata:v1:seasonal-title:title:8a34b1e0db4316ee89894d315ef15800f0dd2cd492e814ab1ef487b8c9bccd12"
      }
    },
    "5_01_004_23_a": {
      "revision": "sha256:de7372bd6331f50e3f8a7ac6c4000284bc044873f8aabc5b254c4f8b0bbb3619",
      "record": {
        "source": "喜ぶ顔が見たいから",
        "text": "因为想看见你开心的表情",
        "source_hash": "sha256:bea7723da16b45a4362e98d9998bc872003110335001c167523544eaa6995fcb",
        "unit_id": "metadata:v1:seasonal-title:title:bea7723da16b45a4362e98d9998bc872003110335001c167523544eaa6995fcb"
      }
    },
    "5_01_010_22_a": {
      "revision": "sha256:19783a3839b4fb83dba7410f11ef0548a0e024556689152fda4a7f15ee16e5de",
      "record": {
        "source": "約束だよ！",
        "text": "约好了哦！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:168fce2d2f843aa2dbfa5e0347c07ef6ce2f5a685b9db61053416b69b2bce9ac",
        "unit_id": "metadata:v1:seasonal-title:title:168fce2d2f843aa2dbfa5e0347c07ef6ce2f5a685b9db61053416b69b2bce9ac"
      }
    },
    "5_01_017_23_a": {
      "revision": "sha256:2b61f66d479107282e32f2a60322e280271b4aa51251e7e56f500d8541b270fd",
      "record": {
        "source": "鼻孔くすぐるあま～い香り",
        "text": "撩动鼻尖的甜～香",
        "source_hash": "sha256:3655a2b781a273894761a11b17a280ef9400575b7c7ca951a45ca94935b73bd2",
        "unit_id": "metadata:v1:seasonal-title:title:3655a2b781a273894761a11b17a280ef9400575b7c7ca951a45ca94935b73bd2"
      }
    },
    "5_01_019_22_b": {
      "revision": "sha256:4f3cb24048e5ea7827b5ef0ae0fb6b9acc17278d6570cbbcfab4e5bb2344e7a3",
      "record": {
        "source": "さりげない心遣い",
        "text": "不经意间的体贴",
        "source_hash": "sha256:bb716ab5ad3cc541d36995d222150958fae5affa260441bfe8b03f10a356a667",
        "unit_id": "metadata:v1:seasonal-title:title:bb716ab5ad3cc541d36995d222150958fae5affa260441bfe8b03f10a356a667"
      }
    },
    "5_01_020_22_b": {
      "revision": "sha256:6de7d61416f0b243a342bee172082641342e97dfbfaf501da8564f0e9a978c48",
      "record": {
        "source": "最高の贈り物",
        "text": "最棒的赠礼",
        "source_hash": "sha256:72e103c9844bbcb257f78accf86ff984ec7121642adea6bf4f4166a9cce072cc",
        "unit_id": "metadata:v1:seasonal-title:title:72e103c9844bbcb257f78accf86ff984ec7121642adea6bf4f4166a9cce072cc"
      }
    },
    "5_01_029_22_a": {
      "revision": "sha256:af7b026d69cf4f47a0cfc91eda869f728298afa7d1826790b6d4cfe3e67c8a1b",
      "record": {
        "source": "戦乙女たちの決戦の日",
        "text": "女武神们的决战之日",
